arfarin","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Warmy","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Weedy","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Whislash","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Whisperain","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wild Mane","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wind Chimes","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Windflit","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Windscoot","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wiš'adel","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wulfenite","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Xingzhu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yahata Umiri","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yato","rarity":2,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yu","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yūtenji Nyamu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zima","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zima the Raging Tide","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zinogre S Catapult","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zuo Le","rarity":6,"isFuture":null}],"techniqueUnitIcons":{},"techniqueBranchOperators":{},"techniqueGroupOperators":{},"techniqueRelatedOperators":{},"forms":null,"skillRanges":null,"overviewRanges":[{"elite":0,"talent":null,"range":{"cols":2,"rows":1,"opCell":[1,1],"rangeCells":[[1,2]]}}],"voiceData":{"textLocale":"en","lines":[{"id":"CN_001","title":"Appointed as Assistant","text":"We're changing shifts right now, Doctor. Just ignore me and get on with your work.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":1},{"id":"CN_002","title":"Talk 1","text":"Back in BSW, I was appointed as a BPRS... you know, Biochemical Protection Response Staff. You can probably imagine what it was like... bulky hazmat suit and all that...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":2},{"id":"CN_003","title":"Talk 2","text":"Hmm? You think I'm a clean freak? Well, Doctor, I see you're unexpectedly direct! I admire your courage.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":3},{"id":"CN_004","title":"Talk 3","text":"Some of the Operators' rooms are in dire need of cleaning. For example, the one belonging to that high-and-mighty teacher's pet. What do you think?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":4},{"id":"CN_005","title":"Talk after Promotion 1","text":"You want to see the intricate pattern on my sword up close? Sure, hold it tight, then. Don't let go—it'll heat up to 2,500 degrees Celcius in 3 seconds! Haha, just kidding! Don't be scared!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":5},{"id":"CN_006","title":"Talk after Promotion 2","text":"Stay clear of that room full of chemical haze, toxins and harmful radiation... that's right, I mean Dr. Kal'tsit's lab.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":6},{"id":"CN_007","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 1","text":"You're asking me for advice regarding the prevention of biochemical contamination? Well, for example... always brush your teeth after eating?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":7},{"id":"CN_008","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 2","text":"Liskarm's been looking so flashy since she got her promotion. 'Hey! Hot girl here! Get your gunsight on me!' I bet that's how she greets the enemies.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":8},{"id":"CN_009","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 3","text":"Good golly, if this is how free life is at Rhodes Island then I might just quit my job at BSW. Liskarm would be upset, though.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":9},{"id":"CN_010","title":"Idle","text":"There's a mosquito on your arm, Doctor.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":10},{"id":"CN_011","title":"Onboard","text":"I'm chemical specialist operator, Franka, here to do my bit to help minimize the pollution wrought by Originium.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":11},{"id":"CN_012","title":"Watching Battle Record","text":"I could perform these techniques anywhere, anytime!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":12},{"id":"CN_013","title":"Promotion 1","text":"Wooow, you're giving me a promotion? I'm having a lot more fun here than at BSW.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":13},{"id":"CN_014","title":"Promotion 2","text":"*Giggle*, you want to see my sword at its most glorious? Too bad, Doctor—you're not qualified yet! If you work at it, maybe one day you'll gain the privilege!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":14},{"id":"CN_017","title":"Added to Squad","text":"All right, I'm ready.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":17},{"id":"CN_018","title":"Appointed as Squad Leader","text":"The best thing about training capable subordinates, is that I get to let them handle all the annoying stuff for me.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":18},{"id":"CN_019","title":"Depart","text":"Well, let's go, then.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":19},{"id":"CN_020","title":"Begin Operation","text":"Too bad... these people have already been contaminated. In that case...","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":20},{"id":"CN_021","title":"Selecting Operator 1","text":"Gotta hurry!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":21},{"id":"CN_022","title":"Selecting Operator 2","text":"No time to hesitate.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":22},{"id":"CN_023","title":"Deployment 1","text":"Offense isn't what I trained for, but hey...","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":23},{"id":"CN_024","title":"Deployment 2","text":"Heavy defenders are SO scary... Hehe, just kidding.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":24},{"id":"CN_025","title":"In Battle 1","text":"Weak spot, Sighted!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":25},{"id":"CN_026","title":"In Battle 2","text":"Let's burn it up!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":26},{"id":"CN_027","title":"In Battle 3","text":"Hold your breath now.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":27},{"id":"CN_028","title":"In Battle 4","text":"Tricked you!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":28},{"id":"CN_029","title":"4-star Result","text":"Obsession with power is a fool's game.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":29},{"id":"CN_030","title":"3-star Result","text":"That was perfect from start to finish. Well done.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":30},{"id":"CN_031","title":"Sub 3-star Result","text":"Just as expected.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":31},{"id":"CN_032","title":"Operation Failure","text":"What, you still have time for that upset face? Fall back now.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":32},{"id":"CN_033","title":"Assigned to Facility","text":"Say, do you have black tea here?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":33},{"id":"CN_034","title":"Tap","text":"Need something?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":34},{"id":"CN_036","title":"Trust Tap","text":"Want to hear about my time at BSW?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":36},{"id":"CN_037","title":"Title","text":"Arknights.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":37},{"id":"CN_038","title":"New Year's blessing","text":"Thanks for the end-of-year bonus, Doctor! It motivates me to work even harder next year. If you've got any tough missions, leave them to me! (Now to get a bonus from Blacksteel too...)","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":38},{"id":"CN_042","title":"Greeting","text":"Gooood morning, Doctor!","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":42},{"id":"CN_043","title":"Birthday","text":"Happy birthday, Doctor! Here's your gift, no tricks attached. Don't forget to make your wish and make it come true! You only live once, after all.","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":43},{"id":"CN_044","title":"Anniversary Celebration","text":"Rhodes Island is a more interesting place than Blacksteel. The medics always look like they're attending my funeral when I get a checkup. It scares me... Yeah, yeah, I know, I'll be good and listen. I have too much on my bucket list to give up now.","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":44}],"packs":[{"id":"en","label":"English","actors":["Maya Aoki Tuttle"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-english/58e999c42e9fb00832d571ab35a1666000557088/current/char_106_franka/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"jp","label":"Japanese","actors":["Ai Kakuma"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-japanese/15ab8a81f1fc3b7e9b5486cf00c5afdc4b948649/current/char_106_franka/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"cn","label":"Mandarin","actors":["Vila"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-mandarin/88535cc2a7c43056f2c370850184545b8c478a43/current/char_106_franka/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"kr","label":"Korean","actors":["Park Ko-woon"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-korean/38e75788058bbbbc5b17330a1591245fbb08f822/current/char_106_franka/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"}]}}}